sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Form as EventForm
    participant Clerk
    participant Convex
    participant DB as Database
    participant Email as lame-mail

    User->>Form: Choose mode (Times or Dates)
    Note over Form: Dates mode hides time range/slot duration.\nPattern: Individual (day pool) or grouped\n(Weekends/Weekdays/Custom → blocks over a range)
    User->>Form: Fill event details
    opt User signed in
        Form->>Clerk: Get auth state
        Clerk->>Convex: getOrCreateUser
        Convex->>DB: Upsert user record
    end
    opt Guest creator
        User->>Form: Enter optional email (for links)
    end
    Form->>Form: generateAdminToken()
    User->>Form: Submit
    Form->>Convex: events.create
    Convex->>DB: Check subscription tier
    Convex->>DB: INSERT event (creatorEmail = account or guest email)
    opt Recipient email resolvable
        Convex->>Convex: schedule sendEventCreatedEmail
        Convex->>Email: Send public + admin links
    end
    Convex-->>Form: eventId + adminToken
    Form->>User: Show success + URLs
